{"sections":[{"slug":"投射模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"投射模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"投射模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个含幺环</span> $R$ (<span lang=\"zh\">不一定交换</span>).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">投射模</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投射对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是投射模当且仅当任意短正合列</span>\n$$\r\n0 \\to A \\to B \\to P \\to 0\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">都分裂</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这也等价于</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是某个自由模的直和项</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">是投射模当且仅当函子</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(P,-)\\colon R\\mathsf {-Mod} \\to \\mathsf {Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">正合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于一般的</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">它一定左正合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但不一定右正合</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">自由</span> $\\Rightarrow$ <span lang=\"zh\">投射</span> $\\Rightarrow$ <span lang=\"zh\">平坦</span> $\\Rightarrow$ <span lang=\"zh\">无挠</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/向量丛-投射模类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">投射模类比</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}